window.products.push({"id":299111,"name":"Mrs. Anderson’s Baking Waffle-Bottom Springform Pan, Round, 8-Inches, Tinned Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711pfj3rGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mrs. Anderson’s Waffle-Bottom Springform Pan is perfect for baking delicate confections with crumb crusts, like creamy cheesecakes, tortes, and more. Made from professional-quality tinned steel so that heat is distributed evenly for uniform baking, from sides to the center. Specially designed as a 2-piece ensemble, the interlocking band hugs the base to form the sides of the pan and prevent leaks during the baking process. Once the cake is done and cooled, it’s easy to spring the sides open with just a flick of the latch fastener and release the base. Simply lift the expanded band from around the base and the confection inside. Baked goods easily transfer from the waffle base to a serving dish. Mrs. Anderson’s Waffle-Bottom Springform Pan is perfect for making delicate confections with crumb crusts, from creamy cheesecakes to tortes, and more. Made from professional-quality tinned steel with a waffle-textured bottom to provide even baking and quick release of delicate baked goods with crumb crusts. Heat safe to 500-degrees Fahrenheit. For best results, never cut baked goods in the pan. Only use wooden or nylon tools that won’t scratch the pan. Hand wash in warm, soapy water and dry thoroughly. Brought to you by HIC Harold Import Co.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711pfj3rGgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mrs. Anderson's Baking","source_asin":"B07V3TCHYZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299111","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V3TCHYZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V3TCHYZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":299112,"name":"Salt Earth Cotton Queen Size 4 Piece Sheet Set Sheets & Ultra Soft Breathable 100% Cotton Sheets with 16 Inch Deep Pocket Sateen Weave Sheets, 600 Thr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qUmuIWBQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% COTTON SHEET SET: This 600 TC Sheet Set by SALT EARTH includes a Flat Sheet 110\"x104\", Fitted Sheet 78\"x80\"x16\" drop and 2 pcs of Pillow Case 20\"x40\" MADE IN INDIA with Premium and finest yield of cotton, these sheets give you a great comfort and smooth finish. The solid colours make your space look Beautiful, luxurious and blends well with any decor. Rest in the softest and coolest 100% COTTON SATEEN WEAVE sheets that are extremely safe for your skin WHY SATEEN WEAVE?: If you are looking for a sheet set that actually stays in its place? this is your best option to think of, Our sheets come's with an all-around elastic that will fit your mattres easily. Meticulously crafted using finest sateen weave, these bedsheets offer divine softness and a long-lasting shine. These natural and breathable cotton sheets make a great choice in all Seasons. It keeps you cool in the hot summers and offers gentle snug comfort in the winters. AVAILABLE IN MULTIPLE COLORS & SIZES: Feel the softness & stunning texture of our sheet sets that are available in 10 colours. Our bed sheets are available in multiple sizes - Twin, Twin XL, Full, King and Queen. Its elegant look & lustrous shine complements every room’s décor, making them the perfect gifting choice for various occasions like birthdays, anniversaries, Christmas, Thanksgiving, housewarmings, or even a baby shower. PREMIUM QUALITY & EASY TO CARE & MAINTAIN: Experience the grandeur of a luxury indulgence when you sleep in these super-soft sheets. These 600 TC sheet sets are fade resistant in nature & look the same after years of washing. Made with natural cotton, our bedsheets are durable & get softer with every wash. Enjoy the comfort of our sheets for a long time, without worrying about colour & shrinkage. We have used high-quality dyes on our sheets that give a brilliant colour & feel to the sheets. CERTIFIED BY THE BEST: Our products are OEKO-Tex certified & have the SEDEX & SA800 certifications to ensure you only receive the best cotton sheets to adorn your rooms. These certifications assure you of the quality & safety standards we practise at our facilities. All fabrics used are 100% eco-friendly, chemical-free & safe to use, making them soothing for even the most sensitive skin. Each sheet is expertly woven together to ensure sheets are fade-resistant, & have a long-lasting strength.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41qUmuIWBQL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Salt Earth","source_asin":"B0C1ZDQ41J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1ZDQ41J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1ZDQ41J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
