window.products.push({"id":299160,"name":"Stove Top Shelf, Magnetic Shelf for Kitchen Stove, Over Stove Spice Rack, Brushed Stainless Steel Back of Stove Extra Storage Organizer Shelves, Oven ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6107p1-cpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brushed Stainless Steel Simple & Effective Solution for Stove to Wall Gap: Are you always worry about your spice bottle falling behind stove ? This solid magnetic stove top shelf that fits on the top of the stove and fill in any gap between your stove and wall. Keeping items from falling behind it Easy No-tool Install - Provide Extra Storage for Your Kitchen: Just put our magnetic shelf on the top of the stove ledge, no drilling or adhesives on your kitchen wall. Provide extra resting place for holding your essential spice bottle, salt, garlic powder, pepper shaker, etc. Keep your small kitchen countertop organized and spice jar within arms reach, save your counter and cabinet space Come with 3 Moveable Strong Magnets: We have add one extra magnet, attaches much easily to the top of your kitchen stove. Adjustable magnets at the bottom can be move to different locations for the various design or shape of the tops. Compared to other Install way, much secure, removable, reusable, washable, won't damage surfaces Easy to Clean & Care: Easy to care, just clean with the damp cloth. Made of sturdy heavy duty brushed stainless steel which keeping it clean and looking like a part of your stove, anti-fingerprint and rust-resistant. High quality material make it strong so not easily deformed, long lasting and durable Fits for Most Stove Top: Measuring 30\"L x 3.5\"W x 1.5\"H, fit for both 30 Inch width flat and slightly curved stoves. Please measure your stove first before ordering","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6107p1-cpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FANGSUN","source_asin":"B09MJ25TP3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MJ25TP3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MJ25TP3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":299161,"name":"WESTFORD Carbon Steel Pan 12\" Super Heavy Duty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iiFvsl08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super high performance due to the superior steel thickness: 1/8\" (3 mm). Thicker than most other brands. This means better heat retention and more even heat distribution. 12\" diameter with 9.25\" flat bottom and 1.75\" depth. 9\" handle. Brushed and polished for the smoothest and cleanest cooking surface. Coating free. Non-toxic. No unhealthy non-stick chemical coatings. Seasoning with cooking oil will develop a natural patina (thin layer) that will give the pan non stick properties. Tougher and lighter than cast iron. Carbon steel cookware will never break. Oven safe. Metal utensil safe. Induction compatible. Rugged, strong build to stand the most demanding outdoor cooking conditions but also great for indoor cooking on regular stoves and ovens. Seasoning required. Hand wash, dry immediately and rub a few drops of cooking oil after each use to prevent from rusting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41iiFvsl08L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WESTFORD","source_asin":"B0B86NQTN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B86NQTN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B86NQTN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
