window.products.push({"id":299214,"name":"Candle Bros’ Soy Wax Scented Candle \"Cactus Flower\" - Over 40 Hours of Burn Time with Fragrance-Enhanced \"Cactus Flower\" Scent - Small-Batch, Hand-Pou","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sFYOXdy+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Choosing the right scented candle for your home activities makes all the difference. As candle lovers ourselves, we wanted to create the perfect candle to accompany anywhere in your home. And we finally did it! The Candle Bros candle is a small batch soy candle that's one-of-a-kind in quality, fragrance, and design. Each 8-ounce candle is made of 100% soy candle wax and is hand-poured into a reusable-glass candle holder. When it comes to finding the right high-quality scented candle, it's all about three key features: 1. Fragrance Load 2. Wick Type 3. Wax Type 1. UNIQUE 10% FRAGRANCE LOAD Most scented candles are made with a 4% - 5% fragrance load. This means that while your candle can burn for hours, you'll never get the full-scented experience. That's why our Candle Bros soy candles are uniquely made with a 10% fragrance load. It means that you get to experience the rich, cactus blossom, wildflower, and natural aromas to their fullest. This one-of-a-kind Cactus Flower scent will help you create that perfect aromatic atmosphere for your home. 2. LEAD-FREE COTTON WICK Our Candle Bros candlewick is properly sized for your 3.4in x 3in x 3in candle. The wick is also made of lead-free cotton, which means that your candle will burn evenly without burning itself out of the reusable-glass candle holder. 3. 100% SOY WAX CANDLE Unlike most candles that are made of paraffin wax, each Candle Bros candle is made from 100% soy wax. Choosing soy wax means that you get to enjoy over 40 hours of clean burn time. ORDER TODAY! Our one-of-a-kind \"Cactus Flower\" scented soy wax candle, complete with its rich aromas of cactus flower, wildflowers, and heady natural scents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sFYOXdy+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Candle Bros. Company","source_asin":"B09KVJYJLT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KVJYJLT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KVJYJLT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":299215,"name":"HYPREST Farmhouse Grey Queen Duvet Cover Set Microfiber Lightweight Soft Solid Color 3Pcs Bedding Set with Exquisite Flouncing Light Grey Vintage Comf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7146ZG30cNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Brushed Microfiber, Standard 100 By Oeko-tex. Special Design: Dress your bed in romantic and sweet ruffles, this grey rustic duvet cover set is ideal for adding a touch of classic style to your guest room or master suite. Featuring a solid, ruffled design, which adds a pop of visual intrigue. Oeko-Tex Certified Fabric: 100% Brushed microfiber made, this fabric is soft and smooth to touch. All our microfiber bedding products are Standard 100 by OEKO-Tex. It is a worldwide independent testing and certification system that can ensure our duvet cover set follows strict manufacturing guidelines. Zipper Closures and 4 Corner Ties: This farmhouse duvet cover set queen size features a YKK hidden zipper to seal your duvet or comforter, zipper closure is more delicate and convenient than the button. And this grey bedding set has 4 corner ties to keep your insert or comforter in place, without the worry of slipping and gathering into a ball while you sleeping. Fine Workmanship Duvet Cover Set: Our duvet cover is finished with fine stitching to ensure a good level of comfort to use for years. Package Included: One 90 x 90 duvet cover and two 20 x 26 pillowcases. Please kindly note this is a duvet cover that doesn't include the insert and comforter. HYPREST offers return and exchange within 30 days of purchase, please no hesitate to reach us if there is any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7146ZG30cNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HYPREST","source_asin":"B0BG8F4L5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299215","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG8F4L5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG8F4L5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
