window.products.push({"id":299327,"name":"Dutsekk 63\"x20\" Full Length Mirror with Lights Standing, Full Body Mirror with Lights Dimmable, LED Floor Mirror Wall Mounted Color Temperature Adjust","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rTa1wunFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Innovative Smart Touch Technology] -- Abandoning the traditional remote control, our full length mirror with lights adopts smart touch technology. Long press the on/off button to adjust brightness. Short touch the color temperature button to change the light color between 3000K, 4500K and 6000K, long press to realize the stepless change of 3000-6000K. You can turn off the button light by long pressing the on/off button when turning off the mirror light, without disturbing your sleep. [Advanced Anti-dead Bead Technology] -- The built in led light strip adopts high color rendering LED chips, low light decay, energy saving and high brightness. Using safety copper core wire, better conductivity and fast heat dissipation, stable current, protect the lamp beads from burning out. If one lamp bead does not emit light, the others lamp beads will glow normally, it will not affect the entire light strip. 50,000 hours lifetime. [Full Length Mirror] -- Size: 63\"x20\", large enough for you to see your entire figure in a single glance. Our full length mirror with lights equipped with a removable and foldable U-shaped bracket, with non-slip pad, which is non-slip and does not damage the floor. The bracket is pre-installed and can be used immediately after opening the package without assembly. Multiple installation methods: standing on the ground, wall mounted, lean to the wall. [Aviation Aluminum Alloy Frame & SQ Grade Float Glass] -- The full length mirror with lights adopts aviation aluminum alloy frame which is strong, anti-rust and elegant. Original edge-sealing technology, lasting and more durable. SQ grade float glass is more high-definition, more corrosion-resistant and does not distort the image compared to automotive grade. And use high-quality explosion-proof film, even if the glass is broken, it will not splash, protecting the safety of you and your family. [Upgraded Packaging] -- The improved packaging has passed drop test, impact test, heavy pressure test. Is greatly reduces damage during transportation. If there are any problems, please feel free to contact us. We will response with the best solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rTa1wunFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dutsekk","source_asin":"B093GQJ91T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093GQJ91T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093GQJ91T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
