window.products.push({"id":299362,"name":"AceMiko Towel Warmer Bucket, Large Towel Warmer for Bathroom, Hot Towel Warmer with LCD Screen, Auto Shut Off, Heat Timer 15/30/45/60, Fits Up to Two ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qRC3JYlsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Large Capacity: Ultra large bucket towel warmers for the bathroom, This bath towel warmer measures (L x W x H) 13” x 13” x 19\", and can accommodate up to 2 large bath towels or personal throw blanket, robe, PJ's, and more. The Acemiko Towel Warmer can be used by the whole family all year round. Two-button Control&Quickly Heating up: This Luxury Bucket Towel Warmer is Two-button control and up to 60 minutes of heating time. Power Button short press to control the towel warmers ON or OFF. Timer Button short press 15-30-45-60min to switch, the default power on is 15min. Whether you're taking a quick shower or a long, relaxing soak, the warmer suits all your needs, use it with more confidence! Child Safety Lock&Easy To Move: To protect children's safety, our heating bucket is equipped with a child lock, which can effectively prevent children from opening the bucket lid and avoid scalding. The lid is detachable, lightweight, and convenient. This towel bucket is also equipped with a leather handle, comfortable touch, and makes it easy for you to move it around in your home. LCD Screen&Customized Fragrance: The towel warmer bucket is user-friendly with a digital LCD screen so your heating could be set by simply pressing a button. You can clearly understand the heating temperature and time of the Large Towel Warmer through the LCD screen. Features a fragrance disc holder, customize your own favorite flavor. A Warm and Sweet Gift: This multi-functional bucket towel warmer makes it an exquisite gift for occasions such as housewarming, weddings, showers or birthdays, anniversaries and mother’s day etc. The perfect accessory for home, pool rooms, showers, salons, hotels, spas, massage, baby care, etc. Once you experience the comfort of a warm towel, it will become a pleasant surprise after your daily bath. Show your friends and family how much you care with this incredible gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qRC3JYlsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AceMiko","source_asin":"B0C4NMGK9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4NMGK9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4NMGK9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
