window.products.push({"id":299373,"name":"White Rose by Cora Niele, 16x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715STkugHeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features the spiraling petals of a white rose. Growing up in her Fatheri1/2s photo studio with cameras and photos everywhere around, Cora absorbed both the technical and esthetical side of photography from a very young age. After high school she did a master in floral design as well as, out of love and interest for art and history, an Academic study cultural sciences. About ten years ago, she got the chance to combine her interests and skills in a company of her own. She started with botanical and garden photography, but over the years her work developed steadily into digital fine art with more abstract designs. Her current work ranges from atmospheric still life in natural light to intricate, technically sophisticated digital fusions, all based on self-shot photographic images. She is inspired by natural, organic shapes. Creating evocative images that distance us from the daily grind, for a moment, is what drives her. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715STkugHeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B01NBN14V2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NBN14V2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NBN14V2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":299374,"name":"Howard Miller Langeland Mantel Clock 635-133 – Hampton Cherry Finish, Vintage Home Decor, Brass Finished Pendulum, Quartz, Dual-Chime Movement, Volume","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":429.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RJ6x973gL._AC_SL1160_.jpg","description":"MANTEL CLOCK: The Langeland Mantel antique clock features a warm Hampton Cherry finish on select hardwoods and veneers to enhance your home decor with its refined and traditional look. It is a perfect decorative piece to place above your fireplace with carved top and bottom caps, decorative molding, and reeded columns. DURABLE: This Howard Miller timepiece features a sturdy frame to relieve stress in a busy household. It has a unique polished brass-finished round pendulum and bezel, and a lamb’s wool dial with black traditional Roman numerals (IIII instead of IV). CHIME MOVEMENT: This mantel clock has a dual-chime movement that plays Westminster or Ave Maria chime to strike each hour with an option to play on the 1/4, 1/2, and 3/4 hour as well. Set the automatic nighttime chime shut-off for volume control to have in any room. DIMENSIONS: The height of this chiming clock is 13.5 inches (34 cm), with a width of 10.5 inches (27 cm) and a depth of 4.5 inches (1 cm). Powered and operated by quartz, dual-chime movement, it requires two C-sized batteries (not included). HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world's leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RJ6x973gL._AC_SL1160_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B007JMZT0S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299374","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007JMZT0S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007JMZT0S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":299375,"name":"The Oliver Gal Artist Co. Drinks and Spirits Wall Art Canvas Prints 'Dom Marbles' Champagne Home Decor, 54in x 36in, Gray, Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nZqAD9O+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enliven any space with Oliver Gal’s exclusively curated collection of gallery-wrapped canvas prints. Each giclée print is an original edition and displays like fine art, with mirrored edges to enjoy your artwork from any angle, for a modern and frameless look. Giclée is a worldwide standard for museum-quality printing, using ultra-premium and fade-resistant inks to guarantee high definition and vivid colors. Our wall art is carefully packaged with a layer of shrink-wrap and heavy-duty foam corner protectors. Oliver Gal is a women-owned and award-winning design house that creates and curates collections of one-of-a-kind artwork and giclées to captivate the most discerning taste. Proudly handcrafted in Miami, USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91nZqAD9O+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Oliver Gal Artist Co.","source_asin":"B09KP89P7Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299375","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KP89P7Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KP89P7Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
