window.products.push({"id":299470,"name":"Multi-color Poppy Sugar and Creamer Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QQ-D0QhTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"With its unique and colorful design, \"poppyful\" pattern, this multicolored poppy and milk sugar set is a must-have addition to the collection of any tea connoisseur who favors personality at their parties. Clusters of bright, boldly colored poppies trickle down into a horizontal bar from the mouth of milk and sugar set to their bare, classic white base. The delicate yet artistic sugar set comes with a gilt gold lid while the smooth and elegant creamer slope allows for precision control when pouring cream into your tea and serving to your guests. Each piece is finished with delicate gold trim, a detail that runs through the contours of the Poppies themselves, making them dance and come alive with color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QQ-D0QhTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gracie China by Coastline Imports","source_asin":"B07CHN6GYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CHN6GYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CHN6GYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":299471,"name":"WISH TREE Cow Print Blanket Soft Fleece Kids Throw Blankets with Cow Print for Couch, Sofa (Round Cow Print, 50 * 60 Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rm7LxHXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MATERIAL : This ultra soft cow print blanket throw made of 100% microfiber polyester which is ventilate,comfortable and durable plus it will no shedding,no pilling,no fading,no shrinking.Constructed using techniques that include better stitching and with high tensile strength, making it strong and less likely to rip or tear. VARIOUS SIZE: The cow throw blanket have three sizes so that you can choose the right size, Small blanket - 40 x 50 inch (100x130cm): baby blanket suitable for baby swaddle and kids nap. Throw blanket - 50 x 60 inch (130 x 150cm): suitable for using as outdoor blanket, sofa blanket and travel blanket, lightweight and easy to carry. Large Blanket - 60 x 80 inch (150 x 200 cm): this size will be more suitable for using in bed and couch. BLACK and WHITE COW PRINT : This black and white Holstein cow pattern is so cute. Perfect for those who love this favorite farm friend and enjoy farmhouse decor.It was a great gift for every bovine lover and those who appreciate a minimalist cow stuff.This cow blanket can decorate your bedding, bedroom and living room. VERSATILE COW BLANKET: This cow blankets that can be used all year and all season round .The cow blankets can as bed blanket / shawl blanket / air-conditional blanket / nap blanket / kids blanket / travelling blanket /camping blanket /pets blanket/picnic blanket. Surround yourself with flannel fleece cow blankets while reading on couch. As a perfect companion while having a comfy nap in your work with our blanket.Suitable for kids, boys, girls. EASY TO CARE: Please clean the cow throw blanket separately. Machine wash in cold water, the washing temperature should not exceed 30°, because high temperature soaking will destroy the fiber structure, gentle cycle, tumble dry low, do not bleach.Tumble dry on lowest heat. Avoid prolonged exposure to the sun and just dry in a cool, ventilated place. This cow blanket will no shedding,no pilling,no fading,no shrinking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rm7LxHXuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WISH TREE","source_asin":"B0BBFQQR3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBFQQR3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBFQQR3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
