window.products.push({"id":299486,"name":"Armen Living LCCASWBAGRB201 Café Adjustable Barstool in Grey Faux Leather and Brushed Stainless Steel Finish, Gray/Walnut, 31.5\" x 19.29\" x 17\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oErA9cMpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Café Adjustable Height Swivel Grey Faux Leather and Walnut Wood Bar Stool with Brushed Stainless Steel Base from Armen Living brings a retro style to modern times. The horizontal channel stich on the seat and back give this stool a refined look while the adjustable metal base allows for convenient placement at your kitchen island, peninsula counter, or home bar. The full 360-degree motion swivel function allows you to easily engage with your friends or family regardless of their place in the room. The high-density foam cushion is wrapped in luxurious faux leather upholstery and allows for extended seating time as well as ergonomic properties to keep your back healthy and properly aligned. The foundation of the product is supported by a metal base and footrest for a chic and stylish aesthetic without comprising practicality and functionality of this item. The Café kitchen stool is a timeless piece that easily incorporates to any home regardless of existing design theme. The Armen Living Café Adjustable Height Swivel Faux Leather and Wood Bar Stool with Metal base is available in your choice of a brushed stainless-steel base with white or grey faux leather upholstery with a walnut back, a grey metal base with grey faux leather upholstery and a walnut back or a black metal base with grey faux leather and a grey walnut wood back.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oErA9cMpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Armen Living","source_asin":"B00XNVCBQ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XNVCBQ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XNVCBQ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":299487,"name":"Brita Large 10 Cup Water Filter Pitcher with 1 Standard Filter, BPA Free – Grand, Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bSdqYWbXL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"With a large 10-cup capacity, the Brita Grand is perfect for larger households. View larger An electronic indicator on the Brita Grand reminds you to change the filter. Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher, Yellow Enjoy healthier*, great-tasting water with the Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher. The Brita Grand comes with a filter that reduces undesirable tastes and odors found in tap water. The electronic indicator reminds you when it's time to change the filter. With a large 10-cup capacity, the Brita Grand provides a convenient and cost-effective alternative to buying bottled water. Filter Provides Great-Tasting Water The Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher comes with one activated carbon and ion-exchange resin filter that reduces chlorine taste and odor, zinc taste, copper, mercury, and cadmium* often found in tap water. One Brita Water Filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles, saving you money and cutting down on waste. Electronic Indicator Tells You When to Replace Filter An electronic indicator on the Brita Grand reminds you to change the filter, ensuring your drinking water is at its most refreshing. The indicator has a simple light system: a blinking green light indicates that the filter is good, a blinking yellow light reminds the user that the filter needs to be changed soon, and a red light blinks after 2 months** or 640 pours*** to show that it is time to replace the filter. Easy to Use This water filter pitcher has a soft grip handle for comfort and a flip-top lid that makes it easy to refill. With a sleek, space-efficient shape, the Brita Grand can be stored on your countertop for room temperature water or in your refrigerator for a colder drink. *Certified to reduce Copper & Mercury. Contaminants reduced may not be in all users’ water. **Filter should be replaced after 40 gallons/151 liters (about 2 months for the average family). ***Based on 8 oz. pours; indicator logic does not account for product misuse. Brita Grand Features Ten (8-ounce) cup capacity Ten (8-ounce) cup capacity 1 filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles 1 filter can replace up to 300 standard 16.9-ounce water bottles BPA free pitcher with comfort grip handle BPA free pitcher with comfort grip handle Flip top lid for easy refilling Flip top lid for easy refilling Electronic filter change indicator Electronic filter change indicator What's in the Box: Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher, Yellow, and one Brita Water Filter. What's in the Box: Brita Grand Water Filter Pitcher, Yellow, and one Brita Water Filter. Directions Your water filter pitcher can be ready for use in just a few steps. Wash your hands before touching the water filter, then soak it upright for 15 minutes in cold water. Rinse under running tap water and insert the filter into the reservoir, lining up the groove in the filter with the notch in the reservoir. Add cold tap water. The first three pitchers of filtered water may contain carbon dust and can be used on plants or discarded. The filter indicator reminds you to replace the water filter every 40 gallons or 2 months. Brita water filter pitchers come in a variety of capacities, styles, and colors.Brita Slim Water Filter PitcherBrita Atlantis Water Filter PitcherBrita Stainless Water Filter PitcherBrita Everyday Water Filter PitcherBrita Grand Water Filter Pitcher Compact (5 or 6 cups) ✓✓ Large (8 or 10 cups) ✓✓✓ Electronic Filter Change Indicator ✓✓ Easy-Fill Lid ✓✓✓ Comfort Grip Handle ✓✓✓ Assorted Colors or Patterns ✓✓ BPA-Free ✓✓✓✓✓","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bSdqYWbXL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brita","source_asin":"B008HRNT1A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008HRNT1A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008HRNT1A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
