window.products.push({"id":299578,"name":"Ice Cube Tray, Mikiwon 2 inch Rose Ice Cube Trays With Covers, 3 Cavity Silicone Rose Ice Tray & 3 Diamond Ice Ball Maker, Easy Release Large Ice Cube","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uw+SLhiKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍷【6 Large Rose & Diamond Ice Cubes】- Rose ice cube molds make 3 Rose & 3 Diamond ice balls at one time. The diameter of each rose ice is 2 inch. Designed wonderfully with the shape of rose and diamond, realistic-looking flower and diamond shaped ice cube create a romantic atmosphere for your party. The rose ice cubes melt much slowly leaving makes your beverages cool longer, prefect for cocktails, iced coffee, iced tea, fruit juice, whisky and bourbon. 🍷【Food Grade Safety Material】- Our ice trays are made of durable food-grade silicone, Reusable and BPA Free, environmentally friendly, non-toxic. Non-sticky surface, easy to demould and clean. Package comes with funnel, easy to fill the water or juice, and just put it into the freezer, you will have perfect ice cubes. 🍷【Stackable & Removable Lid】-Our rose ice tray and diamond ice tray is equipped with a removable silicone cover that prevents ice from absorbing other food air in the refrigerator. And rubber ice cube trays can be easily and neatly stacked in the refrigerator to save space and not be stuck. Clean and tidy. 🍷【Easy to Release and Clean】-The soft silicone material can easily remove the ice cubes. Just push them from behind with your fingers and the ice cubes will slide out. Our stackable silicone ice mold has a smooth silicone surface, which is easy to clean, and it can also be cleaned in the dishwasher. Very convenient! 🍷【Multifunctional Use】- The Rose ice trays can withstand high and low temperatures, can work normally within the range of -104℉ to 446℉. Safe for use in refrigerators, ovens, microwave ovens and dishwasher. Ice Cube Molds great for cocktail, whiskey, bourbon, chilled drinks. It can also use for iced tea, coffee, soda drink and even iced water. This is not just a ice cube maker, it can also be used as jello, mousse mold, sugar mold, chocolate, ice cream, soap making tools.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Uw+SLhiKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mikiwon","source_asin":"B0BRXNVKDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRXNVKDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRXNVKDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
