window.products.push({"id":299695,"name":"Replacement Parts for Shark IQ Robot Vacuum by Techecook - Replacement for Shark IQ R101AE RV1001AE - Includes 6 x Side/Sweep Brush,3 x Hepa Filters,1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fEKcllV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅[COMPATIBLE MODEL] - Shark robot vacuum replacement parts are compatible Shark IQ R101AE(RV1001AE), R101 (RV1001), AV911S, RV912S, RV913S, RV1000, RV1000C, RV1000S, RV1001AEC, RV1001AE, AV1002AE, AV1010AE, AV1102ARUS, UR1000SR, UR1100SRUS, UR1005AE, QR1000SB, QR1000SG, AV970, AV992, AV993 Robot Vacuum. NOT compatible with AV2501 AV2502 RV2501 RV2510 Series vacuum cleaners. If you are not sure whether shark robot filter replacement parts are fit for your machine, please feel free to contact us ✅[EXCELLENT PERFORMANCE] - Shark iq robot replacement parts are made of quality material, the bristles of side brush and rolling brush are wear-resistant which are not easy to break or fall off. The Hepa filter has powerful filtering capabilities to capture fine litter without leaving any dirt and prevent tiny litter over 0.1 micron from entering your brushless motor, extending the life of shark, capture 99.97% of dust and prevent them from being released directly back into the air stream ✅[VALUE PACK] - The shark vacuum robot replacement parts includes 6 x side brushes, 3 x Hepa filters, 1 x main rolling brush and 1 x extra cleaning brush. Filters and brushes are easy to replace as part of routine maintenance and easy to install without any tools. For customers with different frequency of use, it is recommended to replace new side brushes and filters every 2-4 months to maintain the performance of the Shark Robot Vacuum cleaner and protect your health ✅[HOW TO CLEAN] - If Shark side brush you received are bent, you only need to soak it in hot water for a few minutes to restore. In order to maintain the filter performance of the filter, we recommend cleaning the surface dirt frequently with a white brush to extend the service life and reduce the frequency of washing the filter, washing is likely to make fiber deformation and dust blocked mesh. Please ensure that the filter is completely dry before putting it into the sweeper ✅[60 DAYS WARRANTY] - During the warranty period, if the shark robot vacuum brushes have quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customers’ satisfaction are our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fEKcllV7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B09W28MDC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W28MDC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W28MDC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
