window.products.push({"id":299852,"name":"Palm City Products Two Unique Wine Charm Sets - 20 Pieces Total, Beach and World Traveler Themes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715LWbQ3hXL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"If you have ever had that awkward moment trying to figure out who that glass of wine belonged to, then we have the solution for you.  Add a touch of personality to a glass of wine at your next party or wine tasting. This bundle contains two separate sets and twenty unique shaped wine charms on hoops to connect to your stemmed wine or cocktail glass:  -10 Piece Beach Themed Charm Set - Ten unique shapes each bring the beach to your next gathering.  -10 Piece World Travel Themed Charm Set - Ten unique shapes bring some of the world’s most iconic locations to your glass of wine.  What is included with the 10 Piece Beach Themed Charm Set:  Bring the beach to your next glass of wine (but without getting any sand in your glass). There are enough shapes that everyone gets to pick a shape they like with shapes including: conch shell, sea turtle, starfish, sailboat, sea horse, tropical fish, clam shell, palm tree, sun glasses, and a margarita.  What is included with the 10 Piece World Traveler Charm Set:  With ten unique shapes, your friends will feel like you are taking them on a trip around the world with these wine glass decorations. The travel themed themed shapes include: Eiffel Tower, Arc de Triomphe, Dutch windmill, opera house, world globe, Taj Mahal, Leaning Tower, Big Ben, New England lighthouse and a jet plane.  Each charm has a gorgeous antique silver color, made of zinc alloy, and connected to a 30mm x 25mm silver colored hoop. These charms make great gifts, prizes, and giveaways for wine tastings, dinner parties, an evening with a friend, weddings, and bachelorette parties. This bundle makes a perfect gift for a wine lover friend, family member, or if you just feel like treating yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715LWbQ3hXL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Palm City Products","source_asin":"B075DW8YC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-299852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075DW8YC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075DW8YC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
